1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:05,160
Valencio: Please, please, please, I don't know.

2
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,440
Sgt. Kellar: Think of your wife and children.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,660
Valencio: No, they have nothing to do with this!

4
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:12,160
Sgt. Kellar: They will unless you tell me where Lennox is.

5
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:18,060
Valencio: Where did you get that?

6
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,260
Sgt. Kellar: Sit down!

7
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:24,460
Interrogator: Your mission was to take out Valencio, not torture him.

8
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:25,840
Sgt. Kellar: What's going on here?

9
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:30,620
Interrogator: Just answer the question: did you hit the dockyard based on Valencio's information?

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Sgt. Kellar: Yes.

11
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:32,980
Interrogator: Under what authority?

12
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:36,120
Sgt. Kellar: Lieutenant McCarver briefed the Division, and they greenlit the operation.

13
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:43,080
Interrogator: No, they did not. She never went up the chain. McCarver had been under investigation for some time.

14
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:48,400
Interrogator: Your mission ended at the steelworks. You had no authority to execute that operation.

15
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:54,000
Sgt. Kellar: We had a Division docket that outlined the operation. My former team would go in first and pull the trigger.

16
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:58,200
Sgt. Kellar: I was riding shotgun with McCarver and Solomon. Two teams, one area.

17
00:00:58,620 --> 00:00:59,980
Sgt. Kellar: Lennox was the target.
